== technical notes ==

coding zenka dump command:
- p7c coding.dump <namespace> can overflow the SIZE protocol field
  if the namespace has too much content — causes protocol errors and zenka hang
- avoid on large namespaces; use tree_read tool from inside a task instead

cursor address system:
- p7c graphics-matrix.cursor-state — live position from browser
- p7c graphics-matrix.address — all encoding schemes for current position
- p7c graphics-matrix.address goto <addr> — move cursor to address
- p7c graphics-matrix.address label <name> — label current position
- 6 addressing schemes: decimal, checksum, octal-7, base32, directional, label

